e. In the reference folder, she is usually depicted in an art gallery/museum setting; however, this is not a real place. The gallery only exists in her head as a metaphor to her tendencies of observing others, objectifying, and placing them about under her sight, yet too afraid to interact.\n— Please select one of the following designs for the artwork:\n01: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-j1bqeTrl7HQW4DTFadBijhcIkBX8FW5\n02: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11BSCASplM7-E1CqHsIrCcf7BU044Dzby\n\n[Request content]\n— Please draw her with floating fish, or floating fish skeletons\n— Other than that, please have fun with the artwork and draw however you like!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-j1bqeTrl7HQW4DTFadBijhcIkBX8FW5", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_KIKURAKU_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2594842, "client_id": 2533762, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d22c7554/uploads/origins/48e7b0b5-a6bf-46f2-9559-ea723bf2e268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5422ee850cc941eac5ba275acb5610d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d22c7554/uploads/origins/48e7b0b5-a6bf-46f2-9559-ea723bf2e268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5422ee850cc941eac5ba275acb5610d, https://si.imgix.net/d22c7554/uploads/origins/48e7b0b5-a6bf-46f2-9559-ea723bf2e268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21079b1cd7ac03990d9aca3d0d204f28 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d22c7554/uploads/origins/48e7b0b5-a6bf-46f2-9559-ea723bf2e268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a1e43b0304acf1d16fad4a025787cb8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d22c7554/uploads/origins/48e7b